  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163560406-b4178f87-01ab-42c9-acc0-c10c82e295cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地下城与其他结构中现在会生成Boss，超过29种基于原版生物的Boss变体</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>这些Boss拥有自定义能力、属性、战利品和行为/人工智能，每个Boss都是不同的挑战。<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">新版本需要安装<strong>Cuboard</strong>依赖</a><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有Boss都是通过数据包创建的，该模组默认已包含29种Boss。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它们完全可自定义，你也可以轻松添加新Boss。你几乎可以为任何实体制作Boss，包括其他模组的实体。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处查看创建自定义Boss的完整指南：https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a></span></p><p><br>用于测试Boss的命令：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>/brutalbosses spawnboss all&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 生成所有Boss<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss random&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 生成随机Boss<br>/brutalbosses spawnboss &lt;文件名称&gt;&nbsp; &nbsp; 生成指定Boss</p>\n</div><p><br><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组与任何包含可战利品箱子/容器的结构兼容，因为Boss会在这些箱子附近生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用原版战利品表的结构天生兼容，其他结构可通过数据包显式添加支持。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认包含以下结构模组的兼容性：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome Dungeon<br>Awesome Dungeon Edition Ocean</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Awesome dungeon nether<br>Awesome dungeon end</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bygone Nether<br>Dungeon Crawl<br>Dungeons Enhanced<br>Dungeons Plus<br>End Remastered<br>Goblins &amp; Dungeons<br>Illagers+<br>Infernal Expansion</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>It takes a pillage<br>Mo' Structures</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Phillips ruins<br>Stoneholm, Underground Villages<br>The Graveyard</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>The Lost castle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>Towns and Towers<br>Towers of the Wild: Reloaded<br>Towers of the Wild: Additions<br>Valhelsia Structures<br>When Dungeons Arise</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>William wythers<br>YUNG's Better Dungeons<br>YUNG's Better Strongholds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;缺少某个模组？你可以通过数据包轻松添加，请查阅Boss创建指南中的生成部分：<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gist.github.com/someaddons/aa5986b9495863c3b55947a07e243395</a> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有Boss列表：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/685/archmageboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/686/blazeboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/687/cavespiderboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/688/drownedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"630\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/689/endervindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/690/evokerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/691/evokersummoner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/692/ghastboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/693/guardianboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/694/huskboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/695/irongolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/696/madcowboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/697/phantomboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/698/piglinbruteboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/699/pillagerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/700/rabbitboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/701/shulkerboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/702/skeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/703/snowgolemboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/704/strayboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/705/vexboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/706/vindicatorboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/707/witchboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/708/witherskeletonrangedboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/709/witherskeletonshieldboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/710/zoglinboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/711/zombieboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/712/zombietoxicboss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"322\"></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
